   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Nominalisations: two patterns",
     "texto": [
      "Infinitives can be nominalised: **das Entscheiden**, **das Verkaufen**, **das Wohnen**; they are written with a capital letter and are neuter. Other nouns are lexical derivations with their own gender and meaning: **die Entscheidung**, **der Verkauf**, **die Wohnung**. Do not deduce that all derived nouns equal the infinitive: learn the gender and usage with each word."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Adjectives and verbalisation",
     "texto": [
      "Some adjectives form nouns (**frei → die Freiheit**, **gesund → die Gesundheit**), but the form is not always predictable. To return to a verbal sentence, identify who performs the action and turn the noun into its verb: **nach dem Verkauf des Hauses** → **nachdem man das Haus verkauft hat**. The choice of tense depends on the context."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
